<title>GERMANY: Audi ship record 491,900 vehicles in 96.</title>
<headline>Audi ship record 491,900 vehicles in 96.</headline>
<dateline>INGOLSTADT, Germany 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car maker Audi AG said it delivered a record 491,900 vehicles in 1996, up 10 percent from the 1995 total of 448,518.</p>
<p>In Germany, deliveries rose seven percent to 218,000 vehicles from 204,138. The company also said 1996 sales would reach 18 billion marks, up from 16.7 billion marks the year before.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom (49-228) 260 97 150</p>
